Provenance & Asset Licensing Notes:

1. Lunar / Abakos DSP Algorithms (`lunar_integrated_abakos.cpp`,
   `lunar_integrated_components.h`, `lunar_integrated_components.cpp`, `lunar.cpp`):
   Originally authored by Dr. Robert P. Wolf (https://github.com/HERCsMusicSystems/lunar)
   and released under the MIT License (Copyright (c) 2014-2016 Robert P. Wolf).

2. Factory Patch Text Files (`HERCs Abakos PRO/a/*.txt` .. `d/*.txt`,
   `config.txt`, `setup.txt`):
   Redistributed under the explicit grant in Clause 3 of the HERCs Music Systems
   license agreement ("The User may freely modify, copy, create and distribute
   all the text files (*.txt), which are part of the HERCs Software").

3. Microtonal Tuning Files (`HERCs Abakos PRO/Tuning Files/*.scl.tun`):
   Derived from the public-domain Huygens-Fokker Scala scale archive.

4. Graphical User Interface (`src/PluginEditor.h`, `src/PluginEditor.cpp`):
   100% original procedural vector graphics authored by GlitchyGloomy for this
   project. Contains zero third-party or Artvera bitmap assets.
